miglia, spingendo sua madre e sua nonna a riconsiderare le proprie realtà e i propri sogni, innescando un vivace dibattito tra donne."},{"language":"en-US","title":"Dreams","overview":"Johanne falls in love with her teacher and records her fantasies and feelings in writing. Together with her mother and grandmother, they debate the literary potential and whether to publish it."},{"language":"no-NO","title":"Drømmer","overview":"En femten år gammel jente opplever en seksuell oppvåkning da hun forelsker seg nesegrust i sin kvinnelige lærer. Hun skriver dette ned i dagbok, og skriver så bra, levende og gjenkjennelig at både mor og bestemor synes boken bør utgis. Uten å ta høyde for at jenta kun har skrevet det for å golde forelskelsen levende for seg selv."}],"images":{"logos":[{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/vOOA9GRlKO8d2qmj7yyuRO7ogrC.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/vOOA9GRlKO8d2qmj7yyuRO7ogrC.png","language":"en","width":1754,"height":309},{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/eMJKlONyFHrV6LFJW4toxOdczOO.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/eMJKlONyFHrV6LFJW4toxOdczOO.png","language":"en","width":2824,"height":500},{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/pfa9cvCXZnwsYCXtIkEJI4xQZVT.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/pfa9cvCXZnwsYCXtIkEJI4xQZVT.png","language":"en","width":1819,"height":408}],"posters":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ctBhKsd2AGlubApDf7VogbFKRlG.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/ctBhKsd2AGlubApDf7VogbFKRlG.jpg","language":"en","width":2000,"height":3000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/3qGCUTeVlyUszOUqLTwo2vQrJek.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/3qGCUTeVlyUszOUqLTwo2vQrJek.jpg","language":"en","width":2000,"height":3000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/wu2JwlQ3WXZ6TdN2hQfzdviKGFN.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/